## Page 2: Guide Detail (`src/app/guide/[guideId]/[slug]/page.tsx`)

### Current Behavior
- First `useEffect`: Fetches guide, comments, and recommendations in parallel
- Second `useEffect`: Checks like/save/follow status when user is available
- Renders: MediaGallery, title/meta, AuthorCard, GuideActions, ChatTimeline, CommentSection, Recommendations

### Target Architecture

**Server Component Structure:**
```
src/app/guide/[guideId]/[slug]/page.tsx (Server Component)
  - Fetches guide data, comments, recommendations
  - Gets current user from server session
  - Passes data to client wrapper

src/app/guide/[guideId]/[slug]/loading.tsx (NEW)
  - Suspense fallback

src/components/guide/guide-detail-client.tsx (NEW Client Component)
  - Handles user-specific status checks (like/save/follow)
  - Manages interactive state updates
  - Renders all the UI components
```

**Server Component (`src/app/guide/[guideId]/[slug]/page.tsx`):**
```typescript
// NO "use client"
import { notFound } from "next/navigation";
import { createClient } from "@/lib/supabase/server";
import { GuideDetailClient } from "@/components/guide/guide-detail-client";
import { 
  fetchGuideByIdServer, 
  fetchGuideCommentsServer,
  fetchRecommendedGuidesServer 
} from "@/lib/supabase/queries/guide-detail.server";

interface GuideDetailPageProps {
  params: Promise<{ guideId: string; slug: string }>;
}

export default async function GuideDetailPage({ params }: GuideDetailPageProps) {
  const { guideId } = await params;
  const supabase = await createClient();

  // Fetch guide data
  const guide = await fetchGuideByIdServer(supabase, guideId);

  if (!guide) {
    notFound();
  }

  // Parallel fetches for comments and recommendations
  const [comments, recommended] = await Promise.all([
    fetchGuideCommentsServer(supabase, guideId),
    fetchRecommendedGuidesServer(supabase, guideId, guide.category_id),
  ]);

  // Get current user (for passing to client component)
  const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser();

  // Optionally fetch user profile if needed
  let profile = null;
  if (user) {
    const { data } = await supabase
      .from("profiles")
      .select("*")
      .eq("id", user.id)
      .single();
    profile = data;
  }

  return (
    <GuideDetailClient
      guide={guide}
      initialComments={comments}
      recommended={recommended}
      user={user}
      profile={profile}
    />
  );
}
```

